  "notes": "The Kasm Docker Ubuntu Noble Workspace requires libseccomp => 2.5.3 and Linux Kernel 6.3+ to run.\n\nThis can be checked by running runc --version\n\nIf you still want to run Docker Ubuntu Noble but do not have the minimum required libseccomp version, it can be run in an unsecure manner by adding: {\"security_opt\":[\"seccomp=unconfined\"]} to the Docker Run Config Override (JSON) setting above.\n\nNOTE: This will run the Workspace without the docker seccomp sandbox and will significantly reduce the amount of protection that Kasm Workspaces can provide.\n",
